      "description": {
        "fun": "Goomy is said to be the weakest Dragon-type Pokémon: a little slug that's mostly water, coated in a germ-laden slime that makes punches slide right off. If it dries out it can't breathe, so it sticks to damp, shady places, relying on the sensitive horns on its head to sense danger coming. Its name is all goo, gummy and slimy.",
        "guide": "Goomy is a Dragon-type Pokémon from Kalos resembling a small slug. Its body is mostly water and coated in slippery mucus that deflects physical attacks, but it must stay damp to survive. It evolves into Sliggoo and then Goodra, and in Hisui into their Hisuian forms.",
        "tagline": "The weakest dragon, a blob of slime with big ambitions",
