      "description": {
        "fun": "Sliggoo is a blind snail with its brain and heart tucked inside a jelly 'shell'. Its slime dissolves anything, so it sprays prey and slurps them up, and since it can't see well, it sometimes tries to melt its friends by mistake. It's the only Pokémon whose evolution depends on the weather: it has to be raining before it becomes Goodra.",
        "guide": "Sliggoo is a Dragon-type Pokémon, the middle stage of Goomy's line, resembling a snail. It sprays a mucus that dissolves prey and senses the world through its horns, as its eyes have degenerated. It evolves into Goodra only when levelled up in the rain, and has a Steel-type Hisuian form.",
