      "description": {
        "fun": "Goodra is a big softie among dragons: it shows affection by hugging people and leaving them coated in slime, cries gooey tears when left alone, and often misunderstands instructions in a way Trainers find adorable. Push it too far, though, and its retractable horns hit 100 times harder than a heavyweight boxer. It may come from the Lou Carcolh, a slimy serpent of French folklore.",
        "guide": "Goodra is a Dragon-type Pokémon, the final form of Goomy. It is gentle and affectionate, coated in slime that makes attacks slide off, but its horns and tail strike hard when it's provoked. Hisui has a Steel-type Hisuian Goodra with a metal shell.",
